&lt;p&gt;The GUI Agent Living in Your Webpage. Control web interfaces with natural language.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌐 &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; | &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;./docs/README-zh.md&#34; &gt;中文&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://alibaba.github.io/page-agent/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;&lt;b&gt;🚀 Demo&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&#34;https://alibaba.github.io/page-agent/docs/introduction/overview&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;&lt;b&gt;📖 Docs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&#34;https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47264138&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;&lt;b&gt;📢 HN Discussion&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/simonluvramen&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;&lt;b&gt;𝕏 Follow on X&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- demo video --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a1f2eae2-13fb-4aae-98cf-a3fc1620a6c2&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a1f2eae2-13fb-4aae-98cf-a3fc1620a6c2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-features&#34;&gt;✨ Features
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎯 Easy integration&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No need for &lt;code&gt;browser extension&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;python&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;headless browser&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Just in-page javascript. Everything happens in your web page.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📖 Text-based DOM manipulation&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No screenshots. No multi-modal LLMs or special permissions needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧠 Bring your own LLMs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🐙 Optional &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://alibaba.github.io/page-agent/docs/features/chrome-extension&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;chrome extension&lt;/a&gt; for multi-page tasks.&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And an &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://alibaba.github.io/page-agent/docs/features/mcp-server&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;MCP Server (Beta)&lt;/a&gt; to control it from outside&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-use-cases&#34;&gt;💡 Use Cases
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SaaS AI Copilot&lt;/strong&gt; — Ship an AI copilot in your product in lines of code. No backend rewrite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Smart Form Filling&lt;/strong&gt; — Turn 20-click workflows into one sentence. Perfect for ERP, CRM, and admin systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accessibility&lt;/strong&gt; — Make any web app accessible through natural language. Voice commands, screen readers, zero barrier.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-page Agent&lt;/strong&gt; — Extend your own web agent&amp;rsquo;s reach across browser tabs &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://alibaba.github.io/page-agent/docs/features/chrome-extension&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;chrome extension&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MCP&lt;/strong&gt; - Allow your agent clients to control your browser.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-quick-start&#34;&gt;🚀 Quick Start
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;one-line-integration&#34;&gt;One-line integration
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fastest way to try PageAgent with our free Demo LLM:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-html&#34; data-lang=&#34;html&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nt&#34;&gt;script&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;na&#34;&gt;src&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;{URL}&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;na&#34;&gt;crossorigin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;true&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nt&#34;&gt;script&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⚠️ For technical evaluation only.&lt;/strong&gt; This demo CDN uses our free &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://alibaba.github.io/page-agent/docs/features/models#free-testing-api&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;testing LLM API&lt;/a&gt;. By using it, you agree to its &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/alibaba/page-agent/blob/main/docs/terms-and-privacy.md&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;terms&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Mirrors&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;URL&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Global&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/page-agent@1.11.0/dist/iife/page-agent.demo.js&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/page-agent@1.11.0/dist/iife/page-agent.demo.js&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;China&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://registry.npmmirror.com/page-agent/1.11.0/files/dist/iife/page-agent.demo.js&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://registry.npmmirror.com/page-agent/1.11.0/files/dist/iife/page-agent.demo.js&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Add &lt;code&gt;?autoInit=false&lt;/code&gt; to load the script without creating the demo agent automatically. You can then instantiate it with &lt;code&gt;new window.PageAgent(...)&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;npm-installation&#34;&gt;NPM Installation
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;npm install page-agent
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;10
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-javascript&#34; data-lang=&#34;javascript&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kr&#34;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;PageAgent&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;page-agent&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kr&#34;&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;agent&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;PageAgent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;({&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;model&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;qwen3.5-plus&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;baseURL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;apiKey&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;YOUR_API_KEY&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;language&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;en-US&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;})&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kr&#34;&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;agent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;execute&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;Click the login button&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;For more programmatic usage, see &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://alibaba.github.io/page-agent/docs/introduction/overview&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;📖 Documentations&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-awesome-page-agent&#34;&gt;🌟 Awesome Page Agent
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Built something cool with PageAgent? Add it here! Open a PR to share your project.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These are community projects — not maintained or endorsed by us. Use at your own discretion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Project&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Description&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;em&gt;Yours?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
